        {"speaker": "Simran", "pa": "ਤੁਹਾਡੇ ਬੱਚੇ ਹਨ?", "roman": "tuhade bachche han?", "en": "Do you have children?"},
        {"speaker": "You", "pa": "ਹਾਂ ਜੀ, ਮੇਰੇ ਦੋ ਬੱਚੇ ਹਨ।", "roman": "han ji, mere do bachche han.", "en": "Yes, I have two children."}
      ]
    }
  ]
